  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You have begun to unlock the secrets of the stars.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Essence pool of 2 or higher, Knowledge (arcana) 5 ranks, cannot have the constellations class feature.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Choose a single constellation. You gain the ability to manifest the weapon, armor, or equipment options of that constellation as a zodiac of your class level, though you cannot manifest its champion form. You must still pay any essence costs to manifest the constellation as normal.</p>\n<p>You gain 1 point of essence.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> You may take this feat multiple times, choosing a different constellation each time. If you gain the constellations class feature after taking this feat, you must immediately retrain this feat, exchanging it for any other feat you qualify for.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/akashic-feats#toc10\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
